WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,080
fire energy

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:04,730
This is not your doing

3
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,650
Is there any evidence?

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:06,650
I don’t like it

5
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:07,730
Why don't you blame us?

6
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,210
What's going on

7
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:12,890
It's not blood pressure, they're me. I'll fill the water.

8
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:14,690
When I came back, I accidentally spilled water on the fire.

9
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,290
You usually don't pass me by the fire to get water.

10
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:21,260
I went around a bit today, are you sure?

11
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,300
Deal with the fire first

12
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,940
It’s easy to want fire

13
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,460
Give me all three rabbits and hang them with you

14
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,300
Love to change or not to change or not to change

15
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,210
Then eat raw

16
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,690
Three rabbits change fire once

17
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,010
I've taken care of you enough

18
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,090
without my fire

19
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,210
Even if you hold three rabbits, you will only be willing to eat raw meat.

20
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,370
The blood pressure lady is right

21
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,930
Now you have no choice but to look for us

22
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:39,970
Who else can I look for?

23
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:41,930
The three rabbits we exchanged for the whole day

24
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,810
Just press the lighter and press the blood pressure

25
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:46,330
You don’t know how to do business, do you really dare to live without fire?

26
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:47,570
Your rabbits are just raw meat

27
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:48,890
Then let's go to Sioux City to change.

28
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,450
At least it opened before dry fire

29
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:52,170
You won't see three more rabbits in our hands

30
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,010
Temporarily grow one fire into three
